+# ADR-W03-005-sandboxed-cjs-preload
+
+- **Status:** accepted
+- **Onda:** W03
+- **Data:** 2026-09-16
+- **Deciders:** agent / Pedro
+- **Supersedes:** ÔÇö
+- **Superseded by:** ÔÇö
+
+## Contexto
+
+A Wave 3 exige Playwright no Electron j├í built (`file://` + `sandbox: true`). O preload ESM (`.mjs`) com `zod` externalizado n├úo carrega no renderer sandboxed: `window.hub` fica `undefined`. Scripts Vite com `crossorigin` tamb├®m falham no protocolo `file://`.
+
+## Decis├úo
+
+- Preload de produ├º├úo em **CJS** (`out/preload/index.cjs`), com `zod` e `@ai-hub/shared` **empacotados** (n├úo externalizados). `electron` continua externo.
+- `sandbox: true` permanece (ADR-W00-003).
+- HTML do renderer sem atributo `crossorigin`, para o bundle `file://` executar.
+
+## Alternativas consideradas
+
+- **Desligar `sandbox`:** enfraquece a trust boundary.
+- **Interceptar `fetch` no e2e em vez de lan├ºar o build:** rejeitado em ADR-W03-004.
+
+## Consequ├¬ncias
+
+- `pnpm dev` pode emitir preload `.mjs`; o main resolve `index.cjs` / `index.mjs` / `index.js`.
+- Waves futuras n├úo devem voltar a externalizar `zod` no preload sandboxed.
+
+## Refer├¬ncias
+
+- `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` (Wave 3)
+- `docs/ADR/ADR-W00-003-csp-and-window-ipc.md`
+- `docs/ADR/ADR-W03-004-e2e-mock-adapter.md`
+- `docs/reviews/W03/REVIEW.md`
